#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:10
msgid "Explicit-event runtime helpers"
msgstr "显式事件运行辅助组件"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:12
msgid ""
"These optional C11 helpers run in the caller's existing serialized execution"
" path. They do not create threads, OS timers, global ticks or another event "
"queue. Keep immutable tables and contexts live through the final call, and "
"provide independent state for each instance."
msgstr ""
"这些可选 C11 辅助组件在调用方已有的串行执行路径中运行，不创建线程、OS timer、全局 tick "
"或另一套事件队列。不可变表和上下文必须存活到最后一次调用结束，每个实例都须提供独立状态。"

