msgstr "`event_fanout.h`"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:0
msgid "Ordered synchronous sinks with per-emission delivery accounting"
msgstr "有序同步 sink，逐次统计分发结果"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:25
msgid ""
"FSM callbacks must finish within the caller's budget. Events are borrowed "
"only during dispatch; a callback cannot retain their payload implicitly. The"
" flat profile does not implement hierarchical states, history or orthogonal "
"regions; that choice remains `not_selected`. See the [FSM "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/runtime/fsm/README.md) for transition ordering and reentry"
" rejection."
msgstr ""
"FSM 回调必须在调用方预算内结束。事件仅在 dispatch 期间被借用；回调不能隐式保留其 payload。平面 profile "
"不实现层次状态、历史或正交区域；该选项保持 `not_selected`。转换顺序和重入拒绝见 [FSM "
"合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/runtime/fsm/README.md)。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:31
msgid ""
"Periodic, Timers and Debounce consume finite Core microsecond observations. "
"After a clock reset or domain change, join former users and explicitly reset"
" or reinitialize the helper. A new numerical deadline alone does not prove "
"epoch continuity. Periodic releases retain planned phase; they do not "
"refresh the deadline of an already queued I/O request. Timers preserve "
"identity counters on reset so a stale ticket cannot cancel a newly armed "
"event."
msgstr ""
"Periodic、Timers 和 Debounce 使用有限的 Core 微秒时间观察值。时钟重置或域变化后，须等待旧使用者退出，再显式 reset "
"或重新初始化辅助组件。仅有新的数值截止时间不能证明代次连续。周期释放保持计划相位，不刷新已经排队的 I/O 请求截止时间。Timers 在 reset "
"时保留身份计数器，因此旧 ticket 不能取消新设置的事件。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:38
msgid ""
"EventFanout attempts the declared sinks and reports their individual outcome"
" counts and first error; its successful return does not mean every sink "
"accepted the message. Queue sinks use the existing queue's capacity and "
"context rules. Stream sinks retain the existing "
"reserve/publish/acquire/release contract. Copying a pointer in a message "
"does not transfer the pointed-to storage."
msgstr ""
"EventFanout 尝试已声明的 sink，并报告各结果的计数及第一个错误；返回成功不表示每个 sink 都接受了消息。队列 sink "
"使用已有队列的容量与上下文规则。stream sink 保留既有 reserve/publish/acquire/release "
"合同。复制消息中的指针不转移其指向存储的所有权。"

#: ../../../../../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/reference/api/components/runtime/helpers.md:44
msgid ""
"Close upstream event admission before joining dispatchers and sinks. Then "
"drain accepted I/O through its existing owner and join observers before "
"reclaiming shared storage. [Owners](owners.md), [ClockDomain](clock-"
"domain.md) and the [I/O execution guide](../../../../guides/io-execution.md)"
" provide those separate lifecycle contracts. These helpers do not establish "
"callback WCET, GPIO timing or scheduler latency; physical timing remains "
"`not_executed`."
msgstr ""
"先关闭上游事件准入，再等待 dispatcher 和 sink 退出。随后通过既有 owner 排空已接受的 "
"I/O，并等待观察者退出后再回收共享存储。[Owners](owners.md)、[ClockDomain](clock-domain.md) 和 "
"[I/O 执行指南](../../../../guides/io-execution.md) 分别规定这些生命周期合同。这些辅助组件不证明回调 "
"WCET、GPIO 时序或调度延迟；物理时序保持 `not_executed`。"

